+## Install
+
+`pip install tracer-evaldb` for SQLite (library version 3.37 or newer), and
+`pip install "tracer-evaldb[postgres]"` for Postgres (pg8000, a pure Python driver; the URL is
+`postgresql+pg8000://...`).
+
+## Quick start
+
+```python
+import json
+
+import tracer_evaldb as e
+from tracer_evalschema import loader
+from tracer_evalschema.project import Project
+
+engine = e.create_store_engine("sqlite:///store.db")
+e.migrate.upgrade(engine)
+document = {
+    "id": "prj_01a168a1-da00-7394-a377-74bf798c7e70",
+    "schema_version": "0.0.1",
+    "created_at": "2026-10-23T12:00:00.000000Z",
+    "metadata": {},
+    "metadata_flags": [],
+    "name": "Example project",
+    "provider_configs": [],
+}
+project = loader.load_model(Project, json.dumps(document))
+e.store_project(engine, project)
+assert e.load_project(engine, project.id) == project
+print(e.open_store(engine))
+```
+
